/// **Business purpose:** Stores one record per customer, including person or store linkage, sales territory assignment, account reference, and audit details. Supports customer analysis across sales, service, and territory reporting.
/// 
/// **Expected grain:** One row per customer.
/// 
/// **Reporting usage:** Use key fields as identifiers only; do not aggregate. Numeric identifiers should be treated as keys, not measures. Report customer counts, customer segmentation, and territory performance using related sales data.
